# The Ravager, the bridge (TSL, 852NIH, back to 851NIH): the rooms of
# Sith and Dark Jedi to the bridge's door, Visas's last warning (852Visas:
# ready), the long walk to Darth Nihilus (852nih: the party raised in his
# grip, "I will not let you destroy Telos", then the fight), his roar at
# half his health (852nih start 1: Visas asked to break his link to the
# ship, no sacrifice), the fight to his death, Visas taking off his mask
# and the mask given (852end: a_give_item, Force points), what she saw, and
# off the bridge (the Bridge door opened and held open by a_start_ending)
# back to the command deck.
# Starts from the command deck's checkpoint:
#   kjk playthrough tsl @ravager_bridge data/routes/tsl/ravager_bridge.route --god
# Walkthrough: DSimpson's "Ravager - Bridge" (context/walkthroughs/tsl/);
# GameBanshee 58; Kerbow [WRAVBR], [WRAVDN].
# Left: the lockers (one behind the locked door_nih004 north of the second
# room), the [Intelligence]/[Wisdom] lines to Nihilus (c_ac_int_gt and its
# kin: they only weaken him).
#
# ASSUMES:
#   Visas (NPC 9) and Mandalore (NPC 2) in the party. Visas's influence
#   does not matter on the path taken (852nih's R63 branch, which weighs it,
#   is not taken).
#   852NIH_Nihilus_Dead is 0 until a_start_ending sets it (Nihilus at his
#   last HP).
fight 30             # the first room's Sith
fight 40             # the next rooms (Dark Jedi among them)
fight 40
say I am ready. Let's end this. # 852visas at the bridge's door
to 852Visas
talk
say I will not let you destroy Telos. # 852nih start 0 (k_852nih: the party
say Then let us end this. # lifted, 852Nih); a_nihilus: the fight
to 852nih            # the long walk down the bridge
talk
say Can you disrupt that link somehow? # start 1 at half his health
fight 40             # (k_nihilus_ud); Visas holds him (E30: stunned)
talk
while 852NIH_Nihilus_Dead=0
fight 40
end
say Visas... what are you doing? # 852end (a_start_ending)
say Look upon his face, then bring me the mask. # the mask (+Force points)
say Tell me what you saw.
say Then let this ship die, as it should have years ago. # a_end
talk
exit TO_852NIH       # back to the command deck (851NIH's FROM_852NIH)
module 851nih
save ravager_escape
